ction\":\"start\"}","duration_ms":7183,"caller":"/Users/qing/go/src/AI/AI-Agent-Paper/common/dederi/gin/middleware/middleware.go:42 github.com/qingpeng2016/ai-agent-paper/common/dederi/gin/middleware.TraceRequestLog","trace_id":"2610091531057471588849"}
